{"ID":"20240205153731-74yzdqf","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240205153731-74yzdqf","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153731-74yzdqf\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206092908-r7919sb\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240619185515-bm78j96\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:1700,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240619185515-bm78j96\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:3,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:3\u0026#125;","title":"乌药","type":"doc","updated":"20240830104007"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206092908-r7919sb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206092908-r7919sb","updated":"20240206092915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产湖南、浙江等地。\n【性状】\t多呈纺锤状，略弯曲，有的中部收缩成连珠状，长615cm，直径13cm。表面黄棕色或黄褐色，有纵皱纹及稀疏的细根痕。质坚硬。切片厚0.2"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2mm，切面黄白色或淡黄棕色，射线放射状，可见年轮环纹，中心颜色较深。气香，味微苦、辛，有清凉感。\n【性味】\t辛，温。\n【功效】\t行气止痛，温肾散寒。\n【注解】\t“乌药珠”：指乌药纺锤状块根，有的中部收缩呈连珠状。"}]},{"ID":"20240206092908-h0p5jsr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206092908-h0p5jsr","updated":"20240206092908"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206092908-y186vxx.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205162153-6tqfmga","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205162153-6tqfmga","updated":"20240205162153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"乌药"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/乌药-20240205162153-6tol7m0.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205162153-ec8pezw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205162153-ec8pezw","updated":"20240205162153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"乌药2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/乌药2-20240205162153-3cncgx6.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240709112239-kxchdqj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240709112239-kxchdqj","updated":"20240709112405"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 369px;","style":"width: 359px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240709112331-v88rheh.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 359px;\" parent-style=\"width: 369px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 709px;","style":"width: 699px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"乌药3"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/乌药3-20240709112404-3lgage6.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 699px;\" parent-style=\"width: 709px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240709112409-ob3kong","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240709112409-ob3kong","updated":"20240709113017"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"乌药4"},